{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测容器内查找 AWS 密钥文件或环境。对应需求：云凭据窃取。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】容器内搜索AWS凭据","references":["https://sysdig.com/blog/threat-detection-aws-cloud-containers/"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"5749282b-7524-4c9d-af9a-e2b3e814e5d4","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络/文件事件，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 云凭据"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action == \"exec\" and\nprocess.entry_leader.entry_meta.type == \"container\" and\nprocess.name in (\"grep\", \"egrep\", \"fgrep\", \"find\", \"locate\", \"mlocate\", \"cat\", \"sed\", \"awk\") and\nprocess.command_line like~ (\n  \"*aws_access_key_id*\", \"*aws_secret_access_key*\", \"*aws_session_token*\", \"*accesskeyid*\", \"*secretaccesskey*\",\n  \"*access_key*\", \"*.aws/credentials*\"\n)\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n容器进程搜索 ~/.aws、环境变量或元数据相关路径。\n\n### 为何重要\n拿到密钥可横向到云账号。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与时间是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1552","name":"Unsecured Credentials","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1552.001","name":"Credentials In Files","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1005","name":"Data from Local System","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1005/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0009","name":"Collection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0009/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1083","name":"File and Directory Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1083/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":5,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
